<?php if($roleState['board']&&$roleState['board']['checks']): ?><details><summary><?= e($rt('Gespeicherte Vorstandsprüfung')) ?></summary><?php foreach($roleState['board']['checks']as$boardCheck): ?><dl class="role-description"><dt><?= e($rt('Vorstandsamt')) ?></dt><dd><?= e($rt($boardCheck['office'])) ?></dd><dt><?= e($rt('Prüfendes Konto')) ?></dt><dd><?= e($roleActorNames->label($boardCheck['checked_by'],$rt)) ?></dd><dt><?= e($rt('Prüfzeitpunkt')) ?></dt><dd><?= e($boardCheck['checked_at']) ?></dd></dl><?php endforeach ?></details><?php endif ?>
<?php if($u['id']===$roleState['actor']['id']): ?><p><?= e($rt('Dein eigener persönlicher Zugang bleibt geschützt.')) ?> <a class="btn btn-outline theme-secondary" href="/account"><?= e($rt('Mein Konto')) ?></a></p><?php endif ?></section><?php endif ?>
<?php if($roleDraftIndex): ?><details class="card role-open-drafts"><summary><?= e($rt('Meine offenen Entwürfe')) ?> · <?= count($roleDraftIndex) ?></summary><div class="role-native-cards"><?php foreach($roleDraftIndex as$open): ?><a class="role-native-card" href="<?= e($ru(['role_draft'=>$open['id'],'edit'=>null,'new_role'=>null,'role_user'=>null])) ?>"><strong><?= e($rt($roleTitles[$open['operation']])) ?></strong><span><?=e(is_string($open['input']['data']['name']??null)?$open['input']['data']['name']:$rt('Noch nicht gespeichert'))?></span><?php if($open['pending']): ?><span><?= e($rt('Änderungsausgang prüfen')) ?></span><?php endif ?></a><?php endforeach ?></div></details><?php endif ?>
